<title>USA: WPPSS $389 mln bonds repriced, Goldman cuts yields.</title>
<headline>WPPSS $389 mln bonds repriced, Goldman cuts yields.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced Washington Public Power Supply System's $389.3 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2012 to 5.91 percent from 5.95 percent.</p>
